WEBVTT

00:12:30.370 --> 00:12:33.457
So, initially,

00:12:33.457 --> 00:12:37.669
when my community
threw me away as thrash,

00:12:37.711 --> 00:12:40.380
they just thought that they
were doing what was right.

00:12:40.714 --> 00:12:45.344
They thought that they
were doing what was best

00:12:45.385 --> 00:12:49.389
because they learned those things
from Western power,

00:12:49.431 --> 00:12:51.975
Western colonial powers and norms.

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:55.437
And then they learned better.

00:12:55.479 --> 00:12:59.691
They learned that I also
have important and unique values.